Subject: [PATCH 13/13] docs: shadow roots and out-of-process frames, error
 codes, background-tab js latency

Document the frame.diagnose additions, the [code] suffix and --json error
object, the stripped transport keys, and the observed multi-second js
latency on non-active tabs in Brave (content-script tools are
unaffected; tab.switch first or use extract).

